=================================================================================
  SCIENTIFIC EXPERIMENT REPORT: MEMORY ALLOCATION LATENCY & THROUGHPUT
  Parameters: 5 runs x 1000000 allocations of 64 bytes with byte write verification
=================================================================================

[EXPERIMENT 1] Pure C (malloc + write + free individual)
  Run 1:   106.81 ms
  Run 2:    55.11 ms
  Run 3:    56.15 ms
  Run 4:    53.83 ms
  Run 5:    56.30 ms
  >> Mean:    65.64 ms | Min:    53.83 ms | Max:   106.81 ms | StdDev: ±20.61 ms | Latency:    65.64 ns/op

[EXPERIMENT 2] Cplus (ArenaAlloc O(1) + write + batch ArenaReset)
  Run 1:     6.98 ms
  Run 2:    11.62 ms
  Run 3:    11.55 ms
  Run 4:    11.57 ms
  Run 5:    11.55 ms
  >> Mean:    10.65 ms | Min:     6.98 ms | Max:    11.62 ms | StdDev: ± 1.84 ms | Latency:    10.65 ns/op
  >> SPEEDUP:     6.16x FASTER than Pure C

[EXPERIMENT 3] Cplus (PoolAlloc O(1) + write + PoolFree O(1))
  Run 1:    16.16 ms
  Run 2:    19.21 ms
  Run 3:    15.72 ms
  Run 4:    17.47 ms
  Run 5:    15.59 ms
  >> Mean:    16.83 ms | Min:    15.59 ms | Max:    19.21 ms | StdDev: ± 1.36 ms | Latency:    16.83 ns/op
  >> SPEEDUP:     3.90x FASTER than Pure C

